Package: tidymst
Title: Read and Analyse NanoTemper Microscale Thermophoresis Exports
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Brady", "Johnston", , "brady.johnston@me.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read the Excel exports written by NanoTemper's MO.Affinity
    Analysis software (MST traces, capillary scans, dose-response and fit
    results) into tidy data frames, and analyse them: recompute normalised
    fluorescence (Fnorm) from traces, fit Kd and Hill binding models, and
    convert responses to delta Fnorm or fraction bound.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
